### Create player
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "player@example.com",
  "country": "PL",
  "preferredChannel": "PUSH",
  "marketingOptIn": true
}

### Record deposit activity
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/players/{{playerId}}/activity
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activityType": "DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "occurredAt": "2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### Check loyalty account
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/rewards/players/{{playerId}}/account

### List communications
GET http://localhost:8084/api/v1/communications/deliveries
